jglot third-party notices
=========================

jglot is a Java port of sqlglot (https://github.com/tobymao/sqlglot). The following parts of jglot
are derived from sqlglot:

  * The parser, generator, tokenizer, dialects, transforms and optimizer helpers, which are
    translated from sqlglot's Python source.
  * The generated catalogues (TokenType, ExprType, ExprCatalog, Args, DType) and dialect data
    tables (TokenizerData, ParserData, GeneratorData, DialectData, PropertiesLocation), which are
    produced from sqlglot by the scripts in tools/codegen.
  * The parser and generator signature contracts in tools/porting/contracts.
  * The test fixtures under jglot/src/test/resources/fixtures, which are extracted from sqlglot's
    test suite and SQL fixture files by the scripts in tools/fixtures.

